{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_34","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba /Users/smkzw/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md | sed -n '598,606p'\"","aggregated_output":"   598\t- when the user says an optional Yaozh route must not block core research or retain credentials/Cookies/profile -> keep it nonblocking, minimally receipted, and distinguish a persisted receipt from a runnable capability. [Task 3]\n   599\t\n   600\t## Reusable knowledge\n   601\t\n   602\t- v1 framing: one public entry with testable sub-skills; existing `competitive-intelligence-workflow` skill is historical/audit input rather than current authority. The three portal positions are `全景台`, `证据室`, and `设计图谱`; the observed first-version exclusions were PDF/PPT export, spreadsheet export, radar charts, evidence-maturity views, and scheduled monitoring. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   603\t- Separate “few competitors but sufficient decision value” from an apparently under-collected landscape. For key missing data, use independent clean-context review, two recovery rounds plus final review; for competitor-universe completeness, require source convergence plus independent review. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   604\t- Publication handling allows login-dependent source access without credential collection and manual supplement files. Block when a known primary or required extension/long-term publication is unavailable; after explicit one-time confirmation, continuation can be graded rather than silently substituting evidence. Validation targets immune-mediated indications including PNH and IgAN, with large indications for collection completeness and smaller indications for detailed key-trial handling. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   605\t- Recovery must collect outputs from the current `format` node’s explicit `site_relative_path` and `manifest_relative_path`, then validate locked site/manifest plus project, contract, report identity, and snapshot chain. A legacy node lacking those bindings fails closed and preserves historical artifacts. The repaired paths passed `722` integration tests, 11 recovery tests, 42 bounded-review tests, Ruff, strict mypy, and the reported gate suites. [Task 2]\n   606\t- `SemanticGroupingProposal` and `semantic_row_digest` bind a proposal to the full observation digest; source changes invalidate it. Use pairwise compatible complete-link buckets to prevent transitive merging; unknown/uncovered observations remain descriptive and are not dropped. A complete clinical unit includes disease/severity, background therapy, population, endpoint/event definition, scale/direction, estimand, denominator, analysis set, statistical form, and actual time window. [Task 2]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"agent_message","text":"## 结论：rejected\n\n统计数字与当前载荷、derivation sidecar 一致；但 R15 引入了新的实体语义和关联错误，不能以 G11-1 已记档为由接受。\n\n## 个案复查（逐项）\n\n1. `lfg316`：确为独立实体。NCT02534909 原始干预同时包含 `LFG316` 与 `LNP023`。但该试验被归到 `iptacopan`，其 4 条疗效和 2 条安全记录也全部归到 `iptacopan`；`lfg316`自身仍为“未标注/状态未更新/未登记地点”。个案未闭合。\n\n2. `hrs-5965`：产品层已正确归并为一条；片剂/胶囊变体已统一。相关 6 个 NCT 研究仍应分别保留，不能合并为一条试验记录。NCT06593938 的主试验行仍归 `eculizumab`，属于已声明的单产品字段限制，但 HRS 关联未在主表完整呈现。\n\n3. 制剂/复合名仍有残留：`eculizumab-infusion`、`oms906-study-drug`、`lp-005-dose-1` 至 `dose-9`、`ntq5082` 剂量变体、`bcx9930-monotherapy`、`part1/part2-tul321`、`soliris-ultomiris`，以及环孢素/糖皮质激素复合方案。\n\n## 新问题（若有）\n\n- 全干预注册把 `cell infusion`、环孢素、吗替麦考酚酯、马法兰、依托泊苷、G-CSF、利妥昔单抗等背景、对照或移植预处理干预提升为独立产品，违反“创新药竞品宇宙”边界。应保留有限的创新产品集合，背景/对照/预处理仅作为试验干预角色记录。\n- `canonical_drugs` 按名称排序后取首项，改变了来源干预顺序，造成 NCT02534909 的 `LFG316`→`iptacopan` 错投影；这不只是 G11-1 的模型限制。\n- R15 新增的次级干预实体普遍没有直接试验关联，且 78 个产品的 `result_status` 全部相同，产生产品级结果误标。\n- 当前 alias map 未覆盖上述剂量、制剂、品牌、阶段和复合名称，实体宇宙仍未完成规范化闭合。\n\n## 观察意见（原样进入 scientific_review.observations，中文，≤5 条）\n\n1. `lfg316` 已作为独立产品实体生成，但 NCT02534909 及其疗效、安全记录均投影至 `iptacopan`，实体与证据关联尚未闭合。\n2. `hrs-5965` 已在产品层归并为一条，胶囊与片剂变体已消除；相关研究记录仍须按 NCT 分别保留。\n3. 当前载荷仍存在给药方式、剂量、研究用药、阶段和复合方案残留实体。\n4. 全干预注册将细胞输注及传统背景、对照和预处理干预纳入产品集合，混淆创新竞品宇宙与试验干预清单。\n5. 单产品字段限制之外，排序后的首项已造成 LFG316 结果归属错误；需修复干预角色与多对多关系后重新终审。\n\n"}}
